    "detailed_description": "Classic Arcade Fun:<br />\r\nExperience the nostalgia of the classic Bomberman gameplay in a modernized version. Your objective is simple: navigate through mazes, place bombs strategically, and outsmart your opponents to be the last one standing!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nKey Features:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExplosive Action: Engage in fast-paced battles with AI or other players, using bombs to blast through obstacles and defeat enemies.<br />\r\nVaried Levels: Enjoy a variety of challenging levels, each with unique layouts and obstacles that require different strategies.<br />\r\nPower-Ups: Collect power-ups to gain special abilities, such as increased speed, additional bombs, and more powerful explosions.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhether you're a longtime fan of Bomberman or new to the genre, this game offers hours of explosive fun and strategic gameplay. Get ready to blow up the competition!",
